      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Authentication Strategy**\n\nI'm currently focused on the implementation plan for user registration, now leaning toward Firebase Authentication as the external provider. I need to make sure this selection is explicit within the `register_user.py` file. I'm considering how this choice impacts the architecture and dependencies of the program.\n\n\n**Implementing Registration Flow**\n\nI've decided to proceed with Firebase Authentication and am integrating it within `register_user.py`. The file will contain a function, `register_user_with_email_and_password`, that leverages the Firebase Admin SDK. This function handles user creation by calling `auth.create_user`. I'm keeping the focus tight, with the file containing only the required Python code to perform the registration, and no explanations.\n\n\n",
